<h1>⚠️ Approaching Usage Limit</h1>
<p>Hello {{name}},</p>
<p>This is a warning that you have used <strong>{{percentage}}%</strong> of your monthly allowance for <strong>{{limitType}}</strong>.</p>

<div class="stat-box" style="border-left-color: #FFC107;">
  <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: bold; color: white;">Current Allowance Status</p>
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: #A0A0B0;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 4px 0;">Resource Type:</td>
      <td style="padding: 4px 0; text-align: right; color: white;">{{limitType}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 4px 0;">Used:</td>
      <td style="padding: 4px 0; text-align: right; color: white; font-weight: bold;">{{used}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 4px 0;">Total Allowance Limit:</td>
      <td style="padding: 4px 0; text-align: right; color: white; font-weight: bold;">{{limit}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 4px 0;">Reset Date:</td>
      <td style="padding: 4px 0; text-align: right; color: #3ECFCF;">{{resetDate}}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<p>To avoid interruptions and lockouts when you reach 100% of your allowance, we recommend upgrading your pricing plan.</p>

<div style="text-align: center;">
  <a href="{{appUrl}}/pricing" class="btn" style="background: #FFC107; color: black;">⚡ View Upgrade Options</a>
</div>

<p style="margin-top: 24px;">If you have any questions or require custom enterprise limits, please reply directly to this email.</p>
<p>Best regards,<br>The QuickLink Team</p>
